    "title": "July 2026 newsletter",
    "summary": "<p>The June edition of my <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/simonw/\">sponsors-only monthly newsletter</a> is out. If you are a sponsor (or if you start a sponsorship now) you can <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw-private/monthly/blob/main/2026-07-july.md\">access it here</a>.</p> <p>This month:</p> <ul> <li>Accidental cyberattacks by OpenAl and Anthropic models under test</li> <li>GPT-5.6 Sol, Terra, and Luna</li> <li>Claude Opus 5</li> <li>Kimi K3 and DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731</li> <li>Open let",
